<title>USA: Alternative Living completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Alternative Living completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKFIELD, Wis. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Living Services Inc said Thursday it has completed its acquisition of four assisted-living facilities in Wisconsin for $5.5 million in cash.</p>
<p>The four residences have a total capacity of 120 residents.</p>
<p>Alternative Living now operates 76 residences in 11 states.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
